      "details": "Actual independent content review by /root/lesson_content_review_3; report SHA256 b803aef3454eeedee6da39d8ce850a131f827af633061a23b83e3d8800f95edf; original target common_problems_marker_repair. Owner acceptance does not resolve this advisory.",
      "excerpt": "Accept natural Norwegian wording using visst or visstnok to mark an indirect report.",
      "explanation": "The visible task asks the learner to show that the information comes from others and explain the change. It does not require visst or visstnok. The judge and repaired-report criterion make those exact markers mandatory, rejecting a natural explicit-source repair such as «Ifølge en annen kollega kommer Kari senere» with an appropriate explanation.",
